---
config:
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#4f46e5'
    primaryTextColor: '#e2e8f0'
    primaryBorderColor: '#6366f1'
    lineColor: '#94a3b8'
    textColor: '#e2e8f0'
    nodeTextColor: '#e2e8f0'
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> ACTIVE: 螢幕關閉 + 未充電

    ACTIVE --> INACTIVE: inactive_to (1m)

    INACTIVE --> IDLE_PENDING: motion_inactive_to (10m)<br/>等待動態感測器

    IDLE_PENDING --> INACTIVE: 偵測到動作

    IDLE_PENDING --> SENSING: idle_after_inactive_to (1m)<br/>確認靜止

    SENSING --> LOCATING: sensing_to (30s)

    LOCATING --> IDLE: locating_to (15s)

    IDLE --> MAINTENANCE: 進入維護窗口<br/>(≥30s)

    MAINTENANCE --> IDLE: 維護結束, idle 時間指數遞增<br/>15m → 30m → 1h → 2h → 4h → 6h<br/>(×2 倍, 上限 6h)

    IDLE --> ACTIVE: 螢幕開啟 / 動作偵測 / 充電
    MAINTENANCE --> ACTIVE: 螢幕開啟 / 充電

    state IDLE {
        [*]: 最嚴格限制<br/>Alarm 延遲<br/>WakeLock 忽略<br/>App 網路受限<br/>Job/Sync 完全暫停
    }
    state SENSING {
        [*]: 感測器偵測<br/>確認裝置靜止
    }
